# Versioned first release: independent web Demo and selected design documentation.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/web/
!/docs/

# Keep local historical documents/experiments out; admit the curated documentation below.
/docs/**
!/docs/**/
!/docs/README.md
!/docs/STATUS.md
!/docs/product/DIRECTION.md
!/docs/product/ROADMAP.md
!/docs/web/ARCHITECTURE.md
!/docs/web/MOCK_SCENARIO.md
!/docs/web/ACCEPTANCE.md
!/docs/web/evidence/agent-dialog.png
!/docs/web/evidence/artifact-report.png
!/docs/web/evidence/production-first-screen.png
!/docs/assets/README.md
!/docs/assets/registry.json
!/docs/assets/character-provenance.json
!/docs/assets/references/agent-office-target.png
!/docs/reference/VISUAL_DIRECTION.md
!/docs/reference/3D_WORKFLOW.md
!/docs/reference/AGENT_EVENT_CONTRACT.md
!/docs/history/M11_ASSET_REVIEW.md
!/docs/history/DOCUMENTATION_AUDIT.md

# Reproducible outputs and local tooling state are never source.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/coverage/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# 3D source/export assets stay in the local archive for the future 3D track.
*.blend
*.blend[0-9]*
*.glb
*.gltf
*.fbx
*.obj
*.stl
*.usd
*.usdz
*.zip
